  "invariants": [
    "Every compiler step runs on the Spark from sources pinned by sha256 in PINS; a mismatch stops the kit.",
    "omb, ui/ and remote/ are host infrastructure (CLI, UI, harness), never converters.",
    "NOT_RUN and REFUSED are never counted as PASS; verify fails if the negative control is not caught.",
    "The UI binds 127.0.0.1 only and loads nothing from outside the kit."
